    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.4"&gt;11.3.4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Add &lt;code&gt;Window.CanMinimize/CanMaximize&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2831007934" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18117" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18117/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18117"&gt;#18117&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Add &lt;code&gt;Window.IsDialog&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/davisx2/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/davisx2"&gt;@davisx2&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3216220908" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19226" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19226/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19226"&gt;#19226&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Add &lt;code&gt;Calendar.AllowTapRangeSelection&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3280063428" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19367" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19367/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19367"&gt;#19367&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android - Retrieve platform input config value by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3310586895" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19446" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19446/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19446"&gt;#19446&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core - Fix &lt;code&gt;WeakEvent&lt;/code&gt; subscription management thread race condition by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/11v1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/11v1"&gt;@11v1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3287316702" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19383" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19383/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19383"&gt;#19383&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Enable Copy and Cut in &lt;code&gt;ContextMenu&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;code&gt;AutoCompleteBox&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/zrt2399/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/zrt2399"&gt;@zrt2399&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3158914988" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19087" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19087/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19087"&gt;#19087&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Removed all nullability overrides from &lt;code&gt;TimePickerPresenter&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;DatePickerPresenter&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3225129983" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19241" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19241/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19241"&gt;#19241&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Track &lt;code&gt;TabIndex&lt;/code&gt; value in &lt;code&gt;NumericUpDown&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3272214120" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19348" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19348/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19348"&gt;#19348&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls - Fix &lt;code&gt;SplitView&lt;/code&gt; incorrectly closing when the user changes &lt;code&gt;DisplayMode&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;Inline&lt;/code&gt; when &lt;code&gt;IsPaneOpen&lt;/code&gt; is already true by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/danwalmsley/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/danwalmsley"&gt;@danwalmsley&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3317264264" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19460" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19460/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19460"&gt;#19460&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 - Fix a typo in &lt;code&gt;X11Window ClientMessageEvent.ptr5&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/walterlv/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/walterlv"&gt;@walterlv&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3308704969" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19439" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19439/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19439"&gt;#19439&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android - Fix duplicated pointer events by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3308820527" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19440" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19440/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19440"&gt;#19440&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS - Remove non implemented message &lt;code&gt;AvnView.resetPressedMouseButtons&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3310545988" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19445" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19445/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19445"&gt;#19445&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS - Fix thick titlebar mouse event duplication by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ErtyHackward/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ErtyHackward"&gt;@ErtyHackward&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3311015580" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19447" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19447/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19447"&gt;#19447&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/11.3.3...11.3.4"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;11.3.3...11.3.4&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
